    "prompt": "[Intro - Soft]\nThey say peace is coming\nThey say peace is near\nBut who can bring the peace\nThat lasts through every year?\n\nThe Bible gives the answer\nThe hope is shining bright\nJehovah’s Kingdom’s coming\nTo make the whole world right\n\n[Chorus - Big]\nWorld peace is coming\nPeace is on the way\nJehovah’s Kingdom\nWill rule one day\n\nNo more war\nNo more pain\nNo more fear\nNo more hate\n\n“Let your Kingdom come”\nLet your will be done\nJehovah’s Kingdom\nWill bring peace to everyone\n\n[Verse 1]\nLeaders come\nLeaders go\nMaking promises\nWe all know\n\nThey try to fix it\nThey try to lead\nBut human rulers\nCan’t stop greed\n\nThe Bible tells us\nThe truth is clear\nMan can’t direct\nHis own steps here\n\n“Man has dominated man\nTo his harm”\n\nSo where do we turn?\nWho can we trust?\n\nNot human power\nNot human kings\n\nJehovah has promised\nA Kingdom that stays\nA Kingdom forever\nThrough all of our days\n\n“The God of heaven\nWill set up a kingdom\nThat will never be destroyed”\n\nThat’s the Kingdom\nWe put our trust in\n\n[Chorus]\nWorld peace is coming\nPeace is on the way\nJehovah’s Kingdom\nWill rule one day\n\nNo more war\nNo more pain\nNo more fear\nNo more hate\n\n“Let your Kingdom come”\nLet your will be done\nJehovah’s Kingdom\nWill bring peace to everyone\n\n[Verse 2]\nMany religions\nTalk about peace\nBut look at the world\nThe fighting won’t cease\n\nTrue worship teaches\nLove for your brother\nLove for your neighbor\nLove for each other\n\nNo race above race\nNo nation apart\nJehovah’s people\nAre one in heart\n\nThey follow the Christ\nThey follow God’s Word\nThey don’t learn warfare\nThey don’t raise the sword\n\n“They will beat their swords\nInto plowshares”\n\nNo more fighting\nNo more war\nPeace like the world\nHas never known before\n\nFrom every nation\nHis people unite\nServing Jehovah\nAnd doing what’s right\n\n[Verse 3]\nMachines get smarter\nThe world moves fast\nNew inventions\nBuilt to last\n\nBut can a machine\nChange what’s inside?\nCan it take away\nThe anger and pride?\n\nTechnology changes\nThe way that we live\nBut only Jehovah\nCan teach us to give\n\nTo love one another\nTo forgive and be kind\nTo change what’s inside us\nTo change heart and mind\n\n“He is bringing an end\nTo wars throughout the earth”\n\nThat’s Jehovah’s promise\nThat’s what it’s worth\n\n[Bridge - Soft]\nWho can change the heart?\n\nJehovah can\n\nWho can bring true peace?\n\nJehovah can\n\nWho can end the war?\n\nJehovah can\n\nWho will rule the earth?\n\nJehovah’s King\n\n[Verse 4]\nMoney goes up\nMoney goes down\nPeople keep chasing\nThe wealth of this town\n\nChange all the systems\nChange all the plans\nBut money can’t change\nThe heart of a man\n\n“The love of money\nIs a root of all sorts\nOf injurious things”\n\nSo we look higher\nThan silver and gold\nJehovah’s Kingdom\nIs worth more than gold\n\nMicah gave us\nA promise of peace\n\n“Nation will not lift up sword\nAgainst nation”\n\nAnd then he tells us\n\n“They will not learn war anymore”\n\nNo more armies\nNo more fear\nNo more children\nCrying in tears\n\nJehovah will teach us\nThe way we should go\nHis Kingdom will bring it\nWe already know\n\n[Final Chorus - Big]\nWorld peace is coming\nPeace is on the way\nJehovah’s Kingdom\nWill rule one day\n\nNo more war\nNo more pain\nNo more fear\nNo more hate\n\n“Let your Kingdom come”\nLet your will be done\nJehovah’s Kingdom\nWill bring peace to everyone\n\nWorld peace is coming\nHold on to the hope\nJehovah’s promise\nHelps us to cope\n\nWorld peace is coming\nThe promise is true\nJehovah’s Kingdom\nIs coming for you\n\n[Outro - Soft]\nNot human kingdoms\nNot human ways\n\nJehovah’s Kingdom\nWill rule all our days\n\n“Let your Kingdom come”\n\nJehovah’s Kingdom\n\nWorld peace is coming\nPeace is on the way",
