    "prompt": "[Intro — Soft]\n\nI see you in the morning light,\nMy heart comes alive tonight.\nEvery time you look my way,\nI lose the words to say.\n\n[Verse 1]\n\n“You are beautiful, my beloved.”\nBeautiful to me.\n\nYour voice is like a melody,\nYour smile is all I need.\n\nWhen you’re near,\nThe world fades away.\nCome a little closer,\nI just want you to stay.\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n\nCome away with me,\nLeave the world behind.\nStay here in my arms,\nYour heart next to mine.\n\n[Chorus — Catchy]\n\nMY DEAR ONE!\nYou are mine, and I am yours!\nMY DEAR ONE!\nI could never ask for more!\n\nEvery heartbeat,\nEvery dream,\nYou are everything to me.\n\nMY DEAR ONE!\nStay with me tonight!\n\n[Verse 2]\n\nThe winter has passed,\nThe flowers are here.\nYour voice in the distance,\nI know when you’re near.\n\nYou are my garden,\nMy fountain of love.\nNothing compares\nTo the one I’m dreaming of.\n\nWhen you’re far away,\nI call out your name.\nThen you come back to me,\nAnd my heart beats again.\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n\nCome away with me,\nLeave the world behind.\nStay here in my arms,\nYour heart next to mine.\n\n[Chorus]\n\nMY DEAR ONE!\nYou are mine, and I am yours!\nMY DEAR ONE!\nI could never ask for more!\n\nEvery heartbeat,\nEvery dream,\nYou are everything to me.\n\nMY DEAR ONE!\nStay with me tonight!\n\n[Bridge — Emotional]\n\nSet me like a seal\nUpon your heart.\n\nLet nothing in this world\nTear our love apart.\n\n“Love is as strong as death is.”\n\nSo hold me close,\nDon’t let me go.\n\nWhere you are,\nThat’s where I want to be.\n\n[Final Chorus — Big]\n\nMY DEAR ONE!\nYou are mine, and I am yours!\nMY DEAR ONE!\nI could never ask for more!\n\nEvery heartbeat,\nEvery dream,\nYou are everything to me.\n\n“My dear one is mine\nAnd I am her's.”\n\nMY DEAR ONE!\nStay with me tonight!\n\n“You are beautiful, my beloved.”\n\nMy dear one…\n\nYou have my heart.",
